OL,3,GNEWSAMan uses keyless tech to steal    
OL,4,Aeight Mercedes vehicles                
OL,6,FA man who carried out a series of      
OL,7,Fkeyless car thefts targeting high-value
OL,8,FMercedes vehicles has been jailed for  
OL,9,Fthree years.                           
OL,11,FHaroldas Nomeika, 31, of Great         
OL,12,FYarmouth, Norfolk, was arrested        
OL,13,Ffollowing a report that a Mercedes had 
OL,14,Fbeen stolen from a driveway in Drayton,
OL,15,Fnear Norwich, during the early hours of
OL,16,F23 September.                          
OL,18,FHe also admitted seven further thefts  
OL,19,Fduring August and September - in       
OL,20,FTaverham, Diss, Bradwell, Attleborough 
OL,21,Fand Tharston in Norfolk, and in        
OL,22,FLowestoft and Beccles in Suffolk.      
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
