OL,3,GNEWSAMan uses keyless tech to steal    
OL,4,Aeight Mercedes vehicles                
OL,6,FNomeika, of Frederick Road, was charged
OL,7,Fwith four offences, and asked for      
OL,8,Fothers to be taken into account during 
OL,9,Fsentencing at Norwich Crown Court.     
